          <zone h="7463" id="18" type-v2="text" w="100000" x="0" y="88912">
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="false" fontcolor="#202346" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="12">Keep otherwise valid unidentified transactions in sales totals. Preserve ambiguous repeats and disclose their sensitivity until a data owner supplies a reliable line key.
Customer-repeat analysis needs a separate identified-buyer population.</run>
            </formatted-text>
